{"id":106829100047967,"name":"+1 IQ Every Step  🧠[UPD]","desc":"+1 IQ every Step 🧠\n🚶 Walk through the world and gain IQ with every step!\n📚 Buy books to boost your IQ gain to insane levels!\n⚔️ Defeat 14 enemies – from a Baby all the way to the Mega Mind!\n🏆 Collect Wins and unlock new areas!\n🔁 Rebirth to gain even more power and go beyond your limits!\n🤖 Use AutoFarm to keep progressing even while AFK!\n🍹 Activate drink boosts for crazy temporary multipliers!\n🎁 Claim daily gifts and exclusive rewards every day!\nCan you defeat Mega Mind with 2.5 Trillion IQ? 🤯\n\n💛 This game was made by a solo developer! Every bit of support means the world and directly helps fund new updates, more content and a better experience for everyone. If you enjoy the game, consider supporting – it truly makes a huge difference! And also give a Feedback if you want🙏","path":"/game/106829100047967-1-iq-every-step-upd","slug":"106829100047967-1-iq-every-step-upd","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/79a275c53d5f74d2226f5d3f195269886c987a122f66261437ad7010dae5e552.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8f3da6b30e8e4c45b9f37ef185d7da97/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":11822740,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-06T12:27:15.259Z","creator":{"name":"rafimaster009","type":"User"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"+1-IQ-Every-Step-1-IQ-with-Every-Step-Farm-192791","_id":"69d3a6a3829ee6854846cf17","title":"1 IQ with Every Step Farm","game":{"_id":"69ccafab16e15a8c06441d98","gameId":106829100047967,"name":"+1 IQ Every Step  🧠[UPD]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":106829100047967},"features":"On and Off for auto farm wins. Best farm script.","tags":["Farm"],"script":"local player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\n\nlocal pos = Vector3.new(-3.91041565, 7.39100456, 785.351501)\nlocal offsetY = -3\nlocal delayTP = 0.05\n\nlocal ativo = false\n\nlocal gui = Instance.new(\"ScreenGui\")\ngui.ResetOnSpawn = false\ngui.Parent = player:WaitForChild(\"PlayerGui\")\n\nlocal frame = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nframe.Size = UDim2.new(0, 140, 0, 60)\nframe.Position = UDim2.new(0, 20, 0, 200)\nframe.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(25,25,25)\nframe.Parent = gui\n\nlocal botao = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\nbotao.Size = UDim2.new(1, -10, 1, -10)\nbotao.Position = UDim2.new(0, 5, 0, 5)\nbotao.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(170,0,0)\nbotao.Text = \"OFF\"\nbotao.TextColor3 = Color3.new(1,1,1)\nbotao.TextScaled = true\nbotao.Parent = frame\n\ntask.spawn(function()\n    while true do\n        if ativo then\n            local char = player.Character\n            if char then\n                local hrp = char:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n                if hrp then\n                    hrp.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero\n                    hrp.CFrame = CFrame.new(pos + Vector3.new(0, offsetY, 0))\n                end\n            end\n        end\n        task.wait(delayTP)\n    end\nend)\n\nbotao.MouseButton1Click:Connect(function()\n    ativo = not ativo\n    botao.Text = ativo and \"ON\" or \"OFF\"\n    botao.BackgroundColor3 = ativo and Color3.fromRGB(0,170,0) or Color3.fromRGB(170,0,0)\nend)\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastebin.com/raw/3UF7Y1dF\"))()","owner":{"_id":"690fbe3a34128879dd39fe97","username":"afk0830","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/20a9c5d88718819824fd8399cf2599123b9775b1acc8660377e2a56f1eac639c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/690fbe3a34128879dd39fe97-1776480597223.png"},"status":"offline","id":"690fbe3a34128879dd39fe97","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/20a9c5d88718819824fd8399cf2599123b9775b1acc8660377e2a56f1eac639c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/imag